#. Tag: title
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction to the Import Interface"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Import Interface helps you to get photographs into a &digikam; Album, "
"whether it is directly from your camera, from a USB mass storage device, via "
"a card reader or from a local or remote folder. You can access the Import "
"Interface by"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Import</guimenu><guimenuitem>Cameras</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select one of the cameras from the submenu or choose <guilabel>Add Camera "
"Manually...</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The latter will open the dialog described in the <link linkend=\"using-setup-"
"camera\">Camera Settings</link> section of this handbook. If you want to "
"have more information about how &digikam; supports digital cameras, please a "
"take a look at <link linkend=\"intro-camerasupport\">this section</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Import</guimenu><guimenuitem>USB Storage Devices</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select one of the USB devices from the submenu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Import</guimenu><guimenuitem>Card Readers</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select one of the card readers from the submenu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;<keycap>I</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Import</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add Images...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select a source folder from the following dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To be able to use your digital camera with &digikam;, connect the camera to "
"your computer, switch the camera to the image display mode and turn it on. "
"See your camera's user manual if you need more information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: using-camera-intro.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Camera Client Window"
msgstr ""

